Toeplitz matrix whose defining elements are independent with t1 \
\\[Distributed] dist (real) and tk = (xk + I yk)/Sqrt[2] for k > 1,where xk, \
yk \\[Distributed] dist i.i.d. RandomHermitianToeplitz[n, \\[Sigma]] for \
numeric \\[Sigma] is a shortcut for RandomHermitianToeplitz[n, \
NormalDistribution[0, \\[Sigma]]]. RandomHermitianToeplitz[n] assumes the \
standard normal distribution.", "synonyms" -> {}, "tabletags" -> {}, "title" -> 
